## Rule 2: REST API Naming Convention (CRUD)

### URL Structure
```
/api/v1/{resource}           # Collection
/api/v1/{resource}/{id}      # Single item
```

### CRUD Operations
| Operation | HTTP Method | URL Pattern | Controller Method |
|-----------|-------------|-------------|-------------------|
| **C**reate | POST | `/api/v1/orders` | `createOrder()` |
| **R**ead (one) | GET | `/api/v1/orders/{id}` | `getOrderById()` |
| **R**ead (all) | GET | `/api/v1/orders` | `getAllOrders()` |
| **U**pdate | PUT | `/api/v1/orders/{id}` | `updateOrder()` |
| **D**elete | DELETE | `/api/v1/orders/{id}` | `deleteOrder()` |

### Naming Rules
```
✅ CORRECT                    ❌ WRONG
/api/v1/users                 /api/v1/getUsers
POST /api/v1/payments         POST /api/v1/createPayment
DELETE /api/v1/users/{id}     GET /api/v1/deleteUser/{id}
```

