## Rule 3: Comment Complex Code

```java
// ✅ GOOD - Clear and concise
/**
 * Calculate order total with tax and discount applied.
 */
public BigDecimal calculateOrderTotal(Order order) {
    // Get base price from all items
    BigDecimal subtotal = calculateSubtotal(order.getItems());
    
    // Apply tax rate based on shipping region
    BigDecimal taxAmount = calculateTax(subtotal, order.getRegion());
    
    return subtotal.add(taxAmount);
}
```

